## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design CKNE-driven privacy controls in a streaming pipeline, balancing data utility with tenant privacy and regulatory needs.

## Key Concepts
- CKNE health tied to per-tenant redaction policies
- Privacy gating in ingest/processor/store stages
- Edge headers conveying health and policy index
- Validation via targeted tests and privacy audits

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudocode: select redaction by ckneScore
function selectRedaction(ckneScore) {
  if (ckneScore < 0.3) return 'full';
  if (ckneScore < 0.7) return 'partial';
  return 'minimal';
}
```

